{
  "_comment": "One source of truth for the connection-to-settings mapping. qh-ffi tests/mcp.rs and the app's ConnectionEnvironmentTests both read this file: connection is a connections.json row (the app's own field names), secrets are what the Keychain holds, and expect is the value of every key listed in keys (a key missing from an environment counts as empty). <app-known-hosts> stands for each side's own path to the app's known_hosts. SSH_HOST_KEY_ACCEPT and SSH_HOST_KEY_DETAIL are expected empty everywhere: neither side ever sets them from a saved connection.",
